<title>POLAND: ELEKTRIM SIGNS $19.2 MLN CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>ELEKTRIM SIGNS $19.2 MLN CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish industrial and trading conglomerate Elektrim SA has signed a contract worth $19.2 million for exporting electronic components to Russia, the company's spokesman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;Elektrim will deliver on the Russian market electronic components worth total $19.2 million by the end of 1997,&quot; Krzysztof Szczesniak told Reuters.</p>
<p>He declined to give any further details. </p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
